{
 "source": "doug.mp4",
 "segments": [
  {
   "start": 1.071,
   "end": 22.52,
   "text": "the biggest one I actually cried more than I had in a long time wow I dug so deep into myself and my own inner workings that it just it brought out so much pain and I conquered so much pain that I during one exercise I had to stop writing because I couldn't see tears were just streaming down my face"
  },
  {
   "start": 32.153,
   "end": 36.435,
   "text": "So that fear that keeps us trapped in that place where we won't face those things."
  },
  {
   "start": 38.356,
   "end": 40.917,
   "text": "What was it like digging that deep?"
  },
  {
   "start": 43.779,
   "end": 44.319,
   "text": "Enlightening."
  },
  {
   "start": 45.099,
   "end": 51.902,
   "text": "It took a weight off my shoulders, made me feel more alive, and honestly made me want to dig deeper."
  },
  {
   "start": 51.923,
   "end": 54.104,
   "text": "Okay."
  },
  {
   "start": 54.964,
   "end": 56.805,
   "text": "But it wasn't always like that, right?"
  },
  {
   "start": 57.525,
   "end": 61.107,
   "text": "There was a point where you had to overcome some sort of barrier."
  },
  {
   "start": 62.11,
   "end": 64.052,
   "text": "in order to dig deeper into yourself."
  },
  {
   "start": 64.632,
   "end": 71.859,
   "text": "What do you think had to go for you to be able to dig deeper?"
  },
  {
   "start": 72.74,
   "end": 73.28,
   "text": "Stubbornness."
  },
  {
   "start": 77.224,
   "end": 77.765,
   "text": "My ego."
  },
  {
   "start": 81.008,
   "end": 83.61,
   "text": "My ego was a big one because I was like, no, I'm good."
  },
  {
   "start": 84.571,
   "end": 87.814,
   "text": "Society raises men to be big, tough, strong creatures."
  },
  {
   "start": 88.597,
   "end": 89.217,
   "text": "We can't be weak."
  },
  {
   "start": 89.277,
   "end": 90.537,
   "text": "We can't show any signs of weakness."
  },
  {
   "start": 90.617,
   "end": 92.698,
   "text": "Otherwise, the pack is going to attack."
  },
  {
   "start": 94.038,
   "end": 98.279,
   "text": "And that is such a flawed belief that we all just cling to."
  },
  {
   "start": 98.299,
   "end": 100.779,
   "text": "Yeah."
  },
  {
   "start": 100.799,
   "end": 102.68,
   "text": "I actually had a revelation the other day."
  },
  {
   "start": 102.72,
   "end": 108.001,
   "text": "I was writing my name out and trying to rearrange the letters to maybe spell a different name with my name."
  },
  {
   "start": 108.181,
   "end": 110.641,
   "text": "And as I wrote it out, I saw it plain."
  },
  {
   "start": 111.541,
   "end": 115.422,
   "text": "The three letters that are in the dead center of my name are ego."
  },
  {
   "start": 116.488,
   "end": 120.009,
   "text": "And that is the thing that I struggle with the most is the ego, the pride and ego."
  },
  {
   "start": 120.69,
   "end": 129.293,
   "text": "I love that you share that though, that the stubbornness, the ego had to go because I don't think that."
  }
 ],
